# English-only UI copy

Cow Eve is an **English system**. All user-facing text must be written in English.

This includes:

- Placeholders, labels, buttons, tooltips, `aria-label`, and `title` attributes
- Empty states, loading states, and error messages shown in the UI
- Toast, banner, and inline validation copy
- Attachment chips, mention menus, and composer hints

Do **not** add Chinese (or other non-English) strings to frontend components unless the user explicitly requests localization.

Agent instructions and internal code comments may use other languages when the user asks; default product UI remains English.
